  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable development: bridging local disparities for newly created regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Initiation Plan is aimed at detecting regions development priorities of the two newly created regions of Kazakhstan (Ulytau and Abay) to form the ground for full-scale regional development programme aimed at eliminating uneven development at the regional level, improving the quality of life of the population and promoting progress in achieving the Sustainable Development Goals in the regions of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
